    "guid":  "com.icyclawz.itemattributefix",
    "name":  "Item Attribute Fix",
    "slug":  "item-attribute-fix",
    "teaser":  "A universal fix for item attribute tooltip not being updated when the attribute has changed while the inspection window is open.",
    "thumbnail":  "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1232.png",
    "downloads":  21841,
    "favourites_count":  31,
    "description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExtract the ZIP to your SPT-AKI installation folder.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescription:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tooltip shown when hovering over an attribute in the item inspection window is static by default.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn order to update it after an item has been changed (e.g. ammo added to a magazine, mods attached/detached to/from gear, etc.), the inspection window has to be closed and reopened.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis simple client-side mod updates the tooltip’s text the moment the attribute is being updated.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis fix can be used with any mod that utilizes the attribute tooltips (“FullStringValue” field of “ItemAttributeClass”).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis fix was initially made as a companion to my “\u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/909/item-sell-price\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eItem Sell Price\u003c/a\u003e” and “\u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/914/magazine-inspector\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMagazine Inspector\u003c/a\u003e” mods.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
